  },
  "technical_note": "Every attack is a chord of at least three pitches. Bars 5\u20138 place two dotted-half upper chords over three lower half-note chords. The upper voicings grow from three notes to four, then five at the close. Hold all five RH notes across bars 13\u201314 while the pedal clears with the LH change.",
